{"context": {"actorId": "9", "conditions": "", "conversantId": "1", "conversation": "dates/buckyAugustus/dialogue", "conversationId": 135, "entryId": 369, "field": "Dialogue Text", "next": [[135, 370]], "script": ""}, "id": "ds:135:369:Dialogue Text", "ordinal": 1042, "source": "[pic=5]Er.. Ahem! Sorry Rascal… Didn’t mean to get all mushy in front of you…", "sourceSha256": "c2da76b53963a551f57edb35e59b7fae22038bb3a701e110136a941a570e4c52", "target": "[pic=5]ええと…こほん！ すみません、ラスカル…君の前で、こんなに感傷的になるつもりは…", "targetSha256": "98ae4548ab0911e3f3339e1ea3e8299d640b3befdaa87c8d69251d5692d21c7c"}
{"context": {"actorId": "8", "conditions": "", "conversantId": "1", "conversation": "dates/scarlettPenny/dialogue", "conversationId": 139, "entryId": 182, "field": "Dialogue Text", "next": [[139, 183]], "script": ""}, "id": "ds:139:182:Dialogue Text", "ordinal": 1172, "source": "[pic=11]Penny Plume’s Ride and Spoon? Penny Plume’s Ride and Poon?", "sourceSha256": "9c54c389208b0cd7625424099e702838f4b9338320fd927d4ed7709fc55d8ae2", "target": "[pic=11]「ペニー・プルームのライド＆添い寝スプーン」は？ 「ペニー・プルームのライド＆おまんプーン」は？", "targetSha256": "5b649f390c9a4c83f33a47e34426231d4cbb6fff4f77a9c49c5e57b8ff0044f9"}
{"context": {"actorId": "1", "conditions": "", "conversantId": "15", "conversation": "dates/oliverCoyotes/dialogue2", "conversationId": 303, "entryId": 325, "field": "Dialogue Text", "next": [[303, 404]], "script": ""}, "id": "ds:303:325:Dialogue Text", "ordinal": 3354, "source": "We molded the Earth", "sourceSha256": "4cfda961aa21c85ecda38ac13d7b241ee2079a92ab6a7606df2e7559dc3abc75", "target": "地を変えて", "targetSha256": "7047a41b30f6ef66d51553ea545f480834e5a2dca977db734f4c6580121f13e1"}
{"context": {"actorId": "1", "conditions": "", "conversantId": "15", "conversation": "dates/oliverCoyotes/dialogue2", "conversationId": 303, "entryId": 326, "field": "Dialogue Text", "next": [[303, 413]], "script": ""}, "id": "ds:303:326:Dialogue Text", "ordinal": 3355, "source": "Across the raging waters", "sourceSha256": "d0283d3285ca1d9d8f04f99cb3100ca5a01dff6f72364f81e6a1af2e62783832", "target": "荒波越えて", "targetSha256": "b3fd125c873b2a1775e33dde8a740a4db187e0d82e2b5be4ce3d83a4eedbf8fa"}
{"context": {"actorId": "1", "conditions": "", "conversantId": "15", "conversation": "dates/oliverCoyotes/dialogue2", "conversationId": 303, "entryId": 327, "field": "Dialogue Text", "next": [[303, 416]], "script": ""}, "id": "ds:303:327:Dialogue Text", "ordinal": 3356, "source": "To unite our friends", "sourceSha256": "1e88cd471eda141a400327ba4506609d25f3c8a0f295d06f9ac75bee758cc175", "target": "友つなぐ", "targetSha256": "36db19b618f875dd6b067abea7588b45ed20322f75286e4b5941a74f1224071a"}
{"context": {"actorId": "1", "conditions": "", "conversantId": "15", "conversation": "dates/oliverCoyotes/dialogue2", "conversationId": 303, "entryId": 406, "field": "Dialogue Text", "next": [[303, 404]], "script": ""}, "id": "ds:303:406:Dialogue Text", "ordinal": 3406, "source": "Oh lovely Falcon", "sourceSha256": "83c5d22ed4ea07dfec7665439c25eac7dab06620231d5368ee095c3e8a4bbf4d", "target": "ハヤブサよ", "targetSha256": "45e1a93a5e40e944ce92f470c937f4148f23bb29ba77387382c2d17904d823aa"}
{"context": {"actorId": "1", "conditions": "", "conversantId": "15", "conversation": "dates/oliverCoyotes/dialogue2", "conversationId": 303, "entryId": 407, "field": "Dialogue Text", "next": [[303, 413]], "script": ""}, "id": "ds:303:407:Dialogue Text", "ordinal": 3407, "source": "Take me high above the clouds", "sourceSha256": "c97f2da2724f8de67e702fc5655d2811854295a46373f8d0021d45482b138ff3", "target": "雲越え連れて", "targetSha256": "eb49858a1e2f5475bb3b09df54dc862e57ba82030d9f4dddd399b5ef81aa6108"}
{"context": {"actorId": "1", "conditions": "", "conversantId": "15", "conversation": "dates/oliverCoyotes/dialogue2", "conversationId": 303, "entryId": 408, "field": "Dialogue Text", "next": [[303, 416]], "script": ""}, "id": "ds:303:408:Dialogue Text", "ordinal": 3408, "source": "Where no one has gone", "sourceSha256": "eda7b86bbf966e1d9c18727b5a13fd1963e98dd79aa642de355e51fd4e3d2156", "target": "未踏の地", "targetSha256": "a1c7cd6ede3cf994d98e30726ffad0851e4ff186e8344d7ff63c0e9970cf957e"}
{"context": {"actorId": "1", "conditions": "", "conversantId": "15", "conversation": "dates/oliverCoyotes/dialogue2", "conversationId": 303, "entryId": 410, "field": "Dialogue Text", "next": [[303, 404]], "script": ""}, "id": "ds:303:410:Dialogue Text", "ordinal": 3409, "source": "Busy little bug", "sourceSha256": "3c00b34eec68aa4594c7fdce6c254d96aa73c8e7f88226a1cc6053d4dc0c667c", "target": "小虫急く", "targetSha256": "63ba5ff80eb028feec322ec3b6c08e5d10fe98d5de59679eda0bdca5ab63925b"}
{"context": {"actorId": "1", "conditions": "", "conversantId": "15", "conversation": "dates/oliverCoyotes/dialogue2", "conversationId": 303, "entryId": 411, "field": "Dialogue Text", "next": [[303, 413]], "script": ""}, "id": "ds:303:411:Dialogue Text", "ordinal": 3410, "source": "What is important to you?", "sourceSha256": "635346dbbc8d35268a00196326ac89299571c861217fd1402469c92c2da7a1bd", "target": "何が大事か", "targetSha256": "6fe032ad7842801cc308f517cccee42697da63fe481b7411ef1e94b824ae19db"}
{"context": {"actorId": "1", "conditions": "", "conversantId": "15", "conversation": "dates/oliverCoyotes/dialogue2", "conversationId": 303, "entryId": 412, "field": "Dialogue Text", "next": [[303, 416]], "script": ""}, "id": "ds:303:412:Dialogue Text", "ordinal": 3411, "source": "Why must you work now?", "sourceSha256": "8d1eb87ec6a132ee29104614ad1730cb3e7cdb9274b611a70f8f2311756e6de2", "target": "なぜ勤む", "targetSha256": "6a69a42dfea1fde07591e5587e912d831e4decea75a693f789af08e0e48caf4b"}
{"context": {"actorId": "2", "conditions": "", "conversantId": "1", "conversation": "act3/bootyLineUpFemalesQuest/01_introFromBunnies", "conversationId": 942, "entryId": 808, "field": "Dialogue Text", "next": [[942, 809]], "script": ""}, "id": "ds:942:808:Dialogue Text", "ordinal": 10212, "source": "[pic=7]I promised Penny and Mabel first dibs!", "sourceSha256": "a797087822b2d80518fd3016e3e6c21a5560879a5716f27a08f52c997615f88f", "target": "[pic=7]ペニーとメイベルに、最初に使わせるって約束したの！", "targetSha256": "509e60c6514c9b5733181c954c8d71e8fd6079b298dd6a2ac216e21d708b1651"}
